From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Burke Cates <burke.cates@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:13:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] NOT-FOR-UPSTREAM: arm64: dts: qcom: glymur-asus-zenbook-a16: wire the
 WCD9378 headset codec

The 3.5 mm headset jack is driven by a WCD9378 (Tambora) SDCA codec in
compute mode, the arrangement of the Glymur CRD and the Mahua T14s
(laptops-kernel cd2fa85c8d1e): swr1 (RX) is the SoundWire multi-master
dependent and lends its two data lanes, swr2 (TX) is the primary and
enumerates the codec. The codec's reset is TLMM GPIO 191 (16 mA) and
its interrupt the swr2 one (SPI 761); the T14s port tables, DAI links
and routes are taken unchanged.

The codec's 1.8 V and 1.2 V supplies are the ones the WSA884x speakers
already use (L15B, L18B). vdd-mic-bias-supply (BOB1 on the CRD) is left
out for now; the codec gets a dummy supply.

Assisted-by: Claude Code (Opus 5.5)
---
Not-for-upstream: local workaround for one laptop, not reviewed for
  submission; use only for local testing.

 .../qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts | 115 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 114 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts
index 4bcc379d2cd0..6ab1d20f6ecf 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts
@@ -372,7 +372,10 @@ sound {
 				"WooferRight IN", "WSA2 WSA_SPK1 OUT",
 				"TweeterRight IN", "WSA2 WSA_SPK2 OUT",
 				"VA DMIC0", "vdd-micb",
-				"VA DMIC1", "vdd-micb";
+				"VA DMIC1", "vdd-micb",
+				"IT 41 Playback", "HPHL_OUT",
+				"IT 41 Playback", "HPHR_OUT",
+				"TX SWR_INPUT1", "OT 36 Capture";
 
 		va-dai-link {
 			link-name = "VA Capture";
@@ -408,6 +411,39 @@ platform {
 				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
 			};
 		};
+
+		/* WCD9378 headset jack; swr2 is the bus primary (see &swr2). */
+		wcd-playback-dai-link {
+			link-name = "WCD Playback";
+
+			codec {
+				sound-dai = <&wcd9378c 0>, <&swr2 0>, <&lpass_rxmacro 0>;
+			};
+
+			cpu {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apmbedai RX_CODEC_DMA_RX_0>;
+			};
+
+			platform {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
+			};
+		};
+
+		wcd-capture-dai-link {
+			link-name = "WCD Capture";
+
+			codec {
+				sound-dai = <&wcd9378c 18>, <&swr2 1>, <&lpass_txmacro 0>;
+			};
+
+			cpu {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apmbedai TX_CODEC_DMA_TX_3>;
+			};
+
+			platform {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
